[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=6 format=3]

; THE GROUND OF A REAL PLACE (SHADER_terrain_earth.gdshader): twelve CC0 PBR
; layers at 2048 px, blended off the region's control pictures, which
; SCRIPT_earth_dress.gd binds when the island is made (they are each region's
; own). Lit smooth (sun_bands 0), the island's sky ball for the ambient, the
; fog thinner and further off than golf's islands so a valley's far side shows.

[ext_resource type="Shader" path="res://godot/island/shaders/SHADER_terrain_earth.gdshader" id="1_shader"]
